Description: Fits and compares generalized linear mixed models for multiple
    ecological responses and environmental predictors. The package supports
    additive and temporal-interaction candidate models, AICc model selection,
    likelihood-ratio tests, coefficient extraction, Nakagawa R-squared,
    simulation-based diagnostics, figures, and spreadsheet exports.
